Bundled fonts
-------------
All four faces are under the SIL Open Font License 1.1; each license ships next
to the file in assets/fonts/.

- Archivo, Omnibus-Type            assets/fonts/Archivo-Variable.ttf
- Inter, The Inter Project Authors assets/fonts/Inter-Variable.ttf
- Geist Mono, Vercel               assets/fonts/GeistMono-Variable.ttf
- Maple Mono CN, The Maple Mono Project Authors, v7.9. The bundled file is a
  GB2312 subset built by scripts/subset-maple.sh, not the original release.
